    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Pinkerton: The Norma Case</strong>\u00a0is a &quot;point &amp; click&quot; adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Norma</strong>&quot; immerses you in the role of private detective Augustus Pinkerton.<br>The game takes place in June 2240, your mission is to unravel the mystery surrounding the disappearance of Norma X, a 19-year-old young woman.<br><br>Here are some key points of the game to help you understand what awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point &amp; Click :\u00a0</strong>The game is designed in a &quot;point &amp; click&quot; style, meaning you will explore environments by clicking to interact with objects and characters.<br>Playable with mouse/keyboard or xbox joypad.<br>Your adventure can be saved and reloaded at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion through Voice Acting :</strong>\u00a0All dialogues are fully voiced in French, offering total immersion in the story. Additionally, texts are available in both French and English, making it easier for English-speaking players to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully Crafted Soundscape\u00a0:</strong>\u00a0Each level is accompanied by its own music and sound effects, enhancing the game's immersion and atmosphere.<br>The soundtrack helps create a rich and dynamic gaming experience, suited to each stage of your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel Universe :</strong>\u00a0Norma\u00a0takes place in environments entirely created in voxel. Voxels are 3D building units, similar to pixels on a 2D screen.<br>This unique artistic style gives the game a distinctive and attractive aesthetic, reminiscent of both retro games and modern creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into an investigation full of mysteries and surprises with detective\u00a0<i>Augustus Pinkerton</i>\u00a0and his partner\u00a0<i>Hilda</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/3961bae58c630ab90504cf66ac77c810.avif?t=1740791939\" width=800 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Norma in Numbers:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 800 dialogues in French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 1200 lines of text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery and secrets to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 years of development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Pinkerton: The Norma Case</strong>\u00a0is a &quot;point &amp; click&quot; adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Norma</strong>&quot; immerses you in the role of private detective Augustus Pinkerton.<br>The game takes place in June 2240, your mission is to unravel the mystery surrounding the disappearance of Norma X, a 19-year-old young woman.<br><br>Here are some key points of the game to help you understand what awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point &amp; Click :\u00a0</strong>The game is designed in a &quot;point &amp; click&quot; style, meaning you will explore environments by clicking to interact with objects and characters.<br>Playable with mouse/keyboard or xbox joypad.<br>Your adventure can be saved and reloaded at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/75775b9a0b1f5527306483c6e885f470.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion through Voice Acting :</strong>\u00a0All dialogues are fully voiced in French, offering total immersion in the story. Additionally, texts are available in both French and English, making it easier for English-speaking players to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully Crafted Soundscape\u00a0:</strong>\u00a0Each level is accompanied by its own music and sound effects, enhancing the game's immersion and atmosphere.<br>The soundtrack helps create a rich and dynamic gaming experience, suited to each stage of your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/70d40856f13e830e3a3c60f9bc2880c5.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel Universe :</strong>\u00a0Norma\u00a0takes place in environments entirely created in voxel. Voxels are 3D building units, similar to pixels on a 2D screen.<br>This unique artistic style gives the game a distinctive and attractive aesthetic, reminiscent of both retro games and modern creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into an investigation full of mysteries and surprises with detective\u00a0<i>Augustus Pinkerton</i>\u00a0and his partner\u00a0<i>Hilda</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/3961bae58c630ab90504cf66ac77c810.avif?t=1740791939\" width=800 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Norma in Numbers:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 800 dialogues in French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 1200 lines of text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery and secrets to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 years of development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.poster.avif?t=1740791939\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.webm?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402700/extras/db0d3c2b699448745551c9f4c230b0b7.mp4?t=1740791939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
